MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: A12_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: The next three weeks pass like this with me training my powers.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ca644bccb10bda444bd0ff07812d3a81, type: 3}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph also realises that he can not only see the color of the souls but
      also detect any special auras, like the one from John.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He is training experimenting with that by looking at each and every soul
      he encounters.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: When we go out he always tells me when he encounters a person with a special
      aura.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: There are some with the same one as John, so we steer clear from them and
      hide as quickly as possible.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "As for my soul, it turns out that it\u2019s not really that different
      from the rest of the people here in my dimension, it\u2019s just that my aura
      is very bright and shiny due to being a Sustainer."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Those three weeks pass by in a flash and Aleph and I grow even closer in
      that time.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The fourth week starts and I feel like I can try shifting in a more controlled
      way now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph agrees and he holds my hand while I close my eyes, visualising the
      space with the different dimensions again.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph agrees and he holds my hand while I close my eyes, visualising the
      space with the different dimensions again.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2ac81b3fa8c07cf4883385768872e799, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a04c5469befeaad49b67fea842b15ebf, type: 2}
